caption: Cat+Tree++%233+an+all-natural%2C+submitted+by+Joe+Callahan%2C+Director+of+Dogs+%28%E2%80%9CTraitor%E2%80%9D%2C+says+Bandit%29+has+the+cats+still+voting+on+who+will+get+this+cat+tree%21++All-natural+design.++Even+comes+with+your+very+own+spider+%21%21%21++Perfect+for+the+outdoor+environment.++Tying+for+First+Place+in+The+Best+Little+Cat+Tree+in+Town+contest.++%0A%0AJoin+in+the+fun+sign%2C+up+to+receive+Hairballs%2C+the+e-mail+newsletter+with+all+the+stories+of+what%E2%80%99s+coming+up+in+the+crazy+world+of+Animal+Antics%2C+brought+to+you+by+the+critters+of+Rikki%E2%80%99s+Refuge%2C+send+your+request+to+mail%40RikkisRefuge.org%0A%0ADon%E2%80%99t+miss+Sponsor+Appreciation+Day%2C+an+Open+House+at+Rikki%E2%80%99s+Refuge%2C+April+28+from+noon+until+4+p.m.++Tours+run+every+half+hour%2C+refreshments+and+vegan+yummies%2C+the+Great+Baldino+performs+his+magic+show+at+1+p.m.++This+special+event+is+free+tour+Family+Members.++Admission+for+others+is+one+can+of+cat+or+dog+food.++Rikki%27s+Refuge+No+Kill+Animal+Sanctuary%2C+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.RikkisRefuge.org%22%3Ewww.RikkisRefuge.org%3C%2Fa%3E
