caption: Hello%2C%0A%0AThis+is+a+little+collage+that+I+put+together+using+a+cool+program+called%0APicasa+by+Google.+Our+family+is+doing+well+and+we+hope+that+you+are+too.%0APlease+check+out+our+blog+website.+It+is+new+and+in+the+formation+stage%0Abut+let+me+know+if+you%C2%92d+like+to+receive+updates+from+us+that+way.%0APictures+and+updates+will+be+sent+to+you+that+way.+We+hope+that+you+are%0Aall+well.+Lily%2C+Oscar%2C+and+Marlene+and+now+myself+have+been+sick+with+a%0Acold+that+isn%C2%92t+too+fun.+Marlene%C2%92s+mom+is+out+for+the+week+and+that+has%0Abeen+a+blessing+for+us+as+I%C2%92ve+been+preparing+for+some+mid+term+exams+and%0Aworking+a+lot.+Marlene+is+doing+well.+She+is+a+wonderful+mother+and+is%0Aenjoying+her+time+with+the+kids+and+loving+the+time+when+I+come+home+to%0Ahelp+with+the+kids+since+I+pretty+much+am+a+slacker+around+the+house.%0A%0AI+am+busy+with+a+few+jobs+and+keeping+up+with+classes+and+clients+when%0Apossible.+Loving+the+time+and+moments+when+I+get+to+play+with+Oscar+and%0ALily+and+watch+a+movie+and+talk+with+Marlene.%0A%0AOscar+is+growing+up+and+speaking+so+well+for+a+two+year+old.+We+just+love%0Ato+hear+him+repeat+big+words+that+he%C2%92s+never+said+before+like+astronaut%2C%0Aor+word+groupings+like+%C2%93my+fire+truck%C2%94+or+%C2%93read+book%C2%94+or+%C2%93giggle%2C+giggle%2C%0Aquack.%C2%94%0A%0AHope+that+you+are+well.%0A%0APhil+Scoville%0A--%0APosted+by+Phil+Scoville+to+Marlene%0A++%26+Phil+Scoville%0AFamily+Blog+at+5%2F8%2F2005+09%3A40%3A14+PM
