caption: The+attractor+shown+in+black+is+actual+data+representing+the+time+between+arrivals+in+a+particular+%28real%29+manufacturing+shop.++You+can+see+the+essentially+random+arrivals+as+represented+in+the+middle+blob%2C+and+the+%22stars%22+represent+particularly+early+or+late+interarrival+times.++The+red+background+is+the+attractor+of+a+high-dimensional+chaotic+system+as+simulated+in+Excel%2C+and+then+put+through+the+%22swirl%22+effect.
caption: 
