caption: When+teaching+statistics%2C+there+is+a+famous+tool+called+the+%22Quincunx%22%2C+where+a+set+of+marbles+can+be+dropped+through+a+series+of+%22pins%22.++The+ball+bounces+to+the+left+or+right+of+any+given+pin+in+a+%22chaotic%22+manner+%28e.g.+it+is+highly+sensitive+to+small+variations+in+initial+conditions%29%2C+and+where+%28left+to+right%29+it+ends+up+on+the+bottom+is+essentially+a+random+%28or+high+dimensional%29+outcome.++Aggregated+together%2C+the+quincunx+produces+a+normal-shaped+bell+curve+of+outcomes%2C+which+can+be+shown+visually+with+the+marbles.%0A%0AThe+same+idea+is+behind+Lorenz%27s+model+of+ski-hill+moguls+%28from+his+book+%22The+essence+of+chaos%22%29%2C+and+is+described+nicely+in+this+pdf%3A+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fnature.berkeley.edu%2F%7Ebingxu%2FUU%2Fgeocomp%2FWeek8%2FChaos.pdf%22%3Enature.berkeley.edu%2F%7Ebingxu%2FUU%2Fgeocomp%2FWeek8%2FChaos.pdf%3C%2Fa%3E
